IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-BCD-BIAS.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

# Folklore BCD Bias Strategy Example
# Adjusts processing weights prioritizing 256-bit hashes and 160-bit address formats.

SET depth 10;
SET abductive 25;

# Prioritize hash total and key conversion registers (keycodes 80 and 81)
WEIGHT 80 5;
WEIGHT 81 3;

# Prune queue priorities below target values
PRUNE 14;
EVAL;
